title "Ignite"
tempo 120
meter 4/4
key c major
mood stinger
place any
time any
depth any
worlds any
loop no
seed 258
humanize timing 8 ms velocity 4
reverb 2.8 s 0.5
instrument felt font felt preset 0:0
instrument timp font freepats_timpani preset 0:0
instrument strings font freepats_synthstrings preset 0:0
instrument harp font freepats_harp preset 0:0

# Earth's hook, the same as the title's: motif_of(earth_address()), C E C B C D G.
# 120 bpm: a bar is 2 s, so the loud chord on beat 4 of bar 1 falls at 1.5 s and
# the planet appears at 1.6 s. The rest is a settling to a soft C major.
motif hook | p c4:e e4:q c4:q b3:e mf c4:e f d4:e g4:h. r:q |
# The same figure, quiet, as the settling: it hands off to the world's music.
motif calm | pp c4:e e4:q c4:q b3:e c4:e d4:e g4:h. r:q |

part melody felt melody volume -3 dB pan 0.1
  play hook
  play calm
  | pp c4:w |
  | pp c4:w |

